====10th====
*[[Eleanor Bishop|Eleanor]] and [[Kate Bishop]] eat dinner together.{{Ref|HE101}}<ref name="HE101 Opening Credits">The opening credits of ''[[Never Meet Your Heroes]]'' shows a montage of events in Kate Bishop's life. These events are:
*Eleanor Bishop giving Kate a bow and arrow
*Eleanor watching as Kate fires and hits a target twice
*Kate placing a picture of her and Derek on a shelf
*Kate placing a trophy on a shelf
*Kate firing three arrows at two targets
*Kate eating dinner with Eleanor at a young age
*Kate eating dinner with Eleanor while older
*Kate firing an arrow
*Kate achieving third place in a fencing tournament
*Seventeen ribbons and trophies sitting on Kate's shelf
*Eleanor placing her hand on Kate's shoulder as Kate fires an arrow
*Kate achieving second place in a fencing tournament
*Kate as a yellow belt fighting a black belt in karate
*Kate losing a fencing match
*Kate touching her opponent in a fencing tournament
*Kate as a black belt
*Kate doing a flip on a bar
*Kate firing three arrows at three different targets
*Kate making first place in a fencing tournament
*Kate standing on a balance beam on one foot
*Kate standing on the roof of a building on one foot and jumping onto another building
Kate is shown asking Eleanor for a bow and arrow is dated to May 9, 2012 (see other references), so her receiving the bow, which is shown to be soon after, can be taken to be the next day. Since the montage details Kate's training, it can also be understood that the first scene of Kate firing her bow and arrow is meant to be the first time she used it, placing that scene on May 10, 2012 as well.<br>In ''Never Meet Your Heroes'', Eleanor says to Kate, "I still remember when you got your black belt at 15." This event is dated to December 15, 2017 (see [[2017]] references). It takes approximately [https://www.letsrollbjj.com/how-long-does-it-take-to-get-a-black-belt-in-karate/ 54 months] to earn a black belt. However, in ''[[Hide and Seek]]'', Kate says, "I, uh, started martial arts training when I was five." It must therefore be taken that she started at five, but did not take it seriously until after she decided she would protect her family in 2012. Using 54 months prior to when she earned her black belt, June 2013, as a starting point, Kate would have earned her yellow belt at the 3 month mark, in September 2013. She would have earned her orange belt, therefore ending her time as a yellow belt, that December. This fight can therefore be approximated to the midpoint of these dates, October 15, 2013. The scenes preceding this scene can therefore be evenly distributed between May 10, 2012 and October 15, 2013. Similarly, the scenes that follow this scene can be evenly distributed between October 15, 2013, and the start of the present day events, December 19, 2024 (see [[2024]] references), while keeping events clear of events given more specific dates.</ref>

