*In [[London]], [[Darcy Lewis]] tries to call [[S.H.I.E.L.D.]], but they do not return her call. She and Boothby then see the evening news about Selvig's arrest, and decide to get him out of his mental ward.{{Ref|TTDW}}<ref name="TTDW November"/>
*[[File:Thor-SecretWarriorsMeeting.jpg|thumb|250px|Heimdall stands behind [[Thor]] in the meeting]]Thor approaches Heimdall about a secret plan he wishes to enact to save Foster and Asgard. Heimdall agrees to help, and Thor makes plans with [[Sif]] and the [[Warriors Three]].{{Ref|TTDW}}<ref name="TTDW November"/>

====16th====
*'''[[Escape from Asgard]]''': [[Thor]] frees [[Loki]] from the dungeons and takes him to a ship the [[Dark Elves]] left behind. Taking [[Jane Foster]] with them, they abandon the ship and transfer onto a flying boat steered by [[Fandral]]. While Fandral jumps off the boat to fend off a group of Asgardian soldiers, Thor, Loki, and Jane fly through the portal and arrive in [[Svartalfheim]].{{Ref|TTDW}}<ref name="TTDW November"/>
